{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o096a","title":"卫温诸葛直将万人浮海求夷洲亶洲仅得夷洲数千人还","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o096a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"卫温诸葛直将万人浮海求夷洲亶洲仅得夷洲数千人还","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0063","role":"航海","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0064","role":"航海","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":230,"label":"是年遣海军时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y230","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o095","basis":"是年遣海军时"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096a-q","wuzhu-q-o095","houfei-q-o012","houfei-q-b-cbf406b91aa2796bad01"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o096a-q","source_order":[47,504,"O096a"],"order":8294},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o096b","title":"远海亶洲不得至仅得夷洲数千人还","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o096b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"原文记亶洲绝远未至，卫温等仅得夷洲数千人还。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0063","role":"返航","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0064","role":"返航","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"浮海后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o096b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o096b-q","source_order":[47,504,"O096b"],"order":8295},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o097b","title":"卫温诸葛直以违诏无功下狱诛","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o097b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"卫温、诸葛直以违诏无功，下狱处死。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o097b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0063","role":"被诛","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o097b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0064","role":"被诛","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o097b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":231,"label":"黄龙三年春二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y231","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o097","basis":"黄龙三年春二月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o097b-q","wuzhu-q-o097","zhuge-q-o038","zhuge-q-b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o097b-q","source_order":[47,505,"O097b"],"order":8297}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0063","name":"卫温","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o096"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o096-wuzhu-p0063","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o096"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o097-wuzhu-p0063","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o097"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-b-cbf406b91aa2796bad01","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-cbf406b91aa2796bad01","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗四年：太和四年（公元 230）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-776c1db56d4d5699fd84","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"houfei-q-o012","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-743375ca04aa18c715da","layer":"original","quote":"至太和四年春，明帝乃追谥太后祖父广曰开阳恭侯〖12〗，父远曰敬侯〖13〗，祖母周封阳都君，及（恭）〔敬〕侯夫人，皆赠印绶〖14〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o096a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fc10daa0001199bed780","layer":"original","quote":"遣将军卫温、诸葛直，将甲士万人浮海，求夷洲及亶洲〖4〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":503,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o096b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fc10daa0001199bed780","layer":"original","quote":"所在绝远，猝不可得至；但得夷洲数千人还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":503,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":128,"end":148},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o097b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-933251543c833a99d654","layer":"original","quote":"卫温、诸葛直，皆以违诏无功，下狱诛。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":504,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":28,"end":46},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o095","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b0494cc1868e89f464fa","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，魏作合肥新城〖2〗。诏立都讲祭酒〖3〗，以教学诸子。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":502,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o096","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-fc10daa0001199bed780","layer":"original","quote":"遣将军卫温、诸葛直，将甲士万人浮海，求夷洲及亶洲〖4〗。亶洲在海中；长老传言〖5〗，秦始皇帝遣方士徐福，将童男童女数千人入海，求蓬莱神山及仙药〖6〗，止此洲不还。世相承有数万家；其上人民，时有至会稽货布〖7〗。会稽东县人〖8〗，海行，亦有遭风流移至亶洲者。所在绝远，猝不可得至；但得夷洲数千人还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":503,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o097","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-933251543c833a99d654","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖9〗，遣太常潘濬率众五万讨武陵蛮夷〖10〗。卫温、诸葛直，皆以违诏无功，下狱诛。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":504,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-d3a3709d8bfa728137f8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗九年：建兴九年（公元 231）。张郃中箭身亡之处名叫木门，在今天水西南约 60 余公里的牡丹乡木门村，位于祁山以东不远。木门道所经过的峡谷，深邃陡峭，最窄处宽度仅 50 米左右。附近曾有当时的箭镞、刀、矛、弓等文物出土。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7893325ea43d52084752","start":0,"end":113},{"id":"zhuge-q-o038","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-975c90b64c3e4282352a","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖1〗，亮复出祁山，以木牛运，﹝一﹞粮尽退军；与魏将张郃交战，射杀郃。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
